opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis:
  "Native OCaml Zerobus Ingest SDK — OTLP (OpenTelemetry) exporter (Eio)"
description: """
The Eio (direct-style) instantiation of the optional OTLP interface
(DESIGN §4.3): the counterpart of zerobus-otlp (Lwt). An otlp/grpc
LogsService / MetricsService exporter over the Eio H2 transport (reuses
zerobus-eio), sharing the vendored OpenTelemetry collector protos
(zerobus-otlp.proto). Requires OCaml >= 5.0."""
